{"id":"n1-099","title":"Noun をよそに","romaji":"~wo yoso ni","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Despite; Notwithstanding; Regardless of","longExplanation":"The Japanese phrase 'Nounをよそに' is used to express a situation where, despite some circumstance (represented by the noun), a certain action takes place. It can convey a feeling of disregard or nonchalance. In English, it can be translated as 'despite', 'notwithstanding', or 'regardless of'.","formation":"Noun + をよそに","examples":[{"jp":"経済危機をよそに、彼は高級な車を買った。","romaji":"Keizai kiki wo yoso ni, kare wa koukyuu na kuruma wo katta.","en":"Despite the economic crisis, he bought a luxury car.","words":[{"surface":"経済危機","vocabId":"1991640","reading":"けいざいきき"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"よそ","vocabId":"1605940","reading":"よそ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"高級","vocabId":"1283400","reading":"こうきゅう"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"車","vocabId":"1323080","reading":"くるま"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"買った","vocabId":"1473740","reading":"かった","baseForm":"買う"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"試験が迫るをよそに、彼は遊び続けている。","romaji":"Shiken ga semaru wo yoso ni, kare wa asobi tsuzukete iru.","en":"Despite the approaching test, he keeps on playing.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"迫る","vocabId":"1475720","reading":"せまる"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"よそ","vocabId":"1605940","reading":"よそ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遊び","vocabId":"1542070","reading":"あそび"},{"surface":"続けている","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづけている","baseForm":"続ける"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"親の反対をよそに、彼女は彼と結婚しました。","romaji":"Oya no hantai wo yoso ni, kanojo wa kare to kekkon shimashita.","en":"Despite her parents' opposition, she married him.","words":[{"surface":"親","vocabId":"1365040","reading":"おや"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"反対","vocabId":"1480670","reading":"はんたい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"よそ","vocabId":"1605940","reading":"よそ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結婚","vocabId":"1254790","reading":"けっこん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"その国の経済状況をよそに、多くの企業が進出し続けている。","romaji":"Sono kuni no keizai joukyou wo yoso ni, ooku no kigyou ga shinshutsu shi tsuzukete iru.","en":"Despite the country's economic situation, many companies continue to expand.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"国","vocabId":"1592250","reading":"くに"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経済","vocabId":"1251320","reading":"けいざい"},{"surface":"状況","vocabId":"1356700","reading":"じょうきょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"よそ","vocabId":"1605940","reading":"よそ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多く","vocabId":"1861770","reading":"おおく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"企業","vocabId":"1218190","reading":"きぎょう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"進出","vocabId":"1366080","reading":"しんしゅつ"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"続けている","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづけている","baseForm":"続ける"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]}],"kind":"construction"}